      "source_sha256": "9e408683b0a4e887a2085c486d9f80b57a62dc4ec1bf681a14e3662af79aad3a",
      "description": "Current model 3180 在一行一个 transfer_lead_id 粒度固定输出 lead_count=1，按看板目标维度求和得到 TMK 转移线索数。",
